│                                                                              │
│ Telling permission errors from expired windows                               │
│                                                                              │
│ The client reads SC's 403 body: with the permission marker it returns        │
│ ErrPermission and the run fails; without it the window expired, so it books  │
│ an end check and returns ErrScanWindow, which the collector treats as an     │
│ empty window. The cursor is saved when reading ends.                         │
